<p>\( x_1= \) [[input:ans5]] ,\(  y_1= \)&nbsp;[[input:ans6]]&nbsp;[[validation:ans5]] [[validation:ans6]]<br></p>
<p>\( x_2= \) [[input:ans7]] ,\(&nbsp;y_2= \)&nbsp;[[input:ans8]]&nbsp;[[validation:ans7]] [[validation:ans8]]<br></p><p style="color:red"><span><i>Warning!: Make sure that your </i></span>\( x \)<span>&nbsp;<span><i>s and </i><span style=""></span>\( y \)<span style="">&nbsp;</span><i>s are typed in the correct place and in the correct order!</i></span></span></p>[[feedback:prt8]]<p></p><p style="text-align: right;"><b>(3)<br></b></p><p></p>]]></text>
